    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3447" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">archĭtectūra</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the art of building</i>, <i>architecture</i>, =
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχιτεκτονία</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, * <i><span class="en">Cic. Off.
				1, 42, 151</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 1, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 3</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of historical representation: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Specus ipsa quā concameratur
					architecturā!</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					11, 24, 28, § 82</span></i>
			.</div>
